	(text "NOTES\n1.) When the DC/DC converter is not used, the inductor between DCDC_SW and VDDR can be \n    removed. VDDR and VDDR_RF must still be connected and the 22 uF DCDC capacitor \n    must be kept on the VDDR net.\n2.) EGP is the only ground connection for the device. Good electrical connection to \n    device ground on printed circuit board (PCB) is imperative for proper device \n    operation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
